    "title": "Cause of death released for Daviess County inmate - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ian Young ,\n1 hours ago HENDERSON, Ky. (WEHT) — The cause of death has been released for a Daviess County inmate who dies in August.\nTroopers say the medical examiner ruled Dalton Gordon’s, 28, death as acute drug intoxication. Officials say jail staff found Gordon unresponsive in his cell on the morning of August 20.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
